      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does WRYDECO standard shipping include in-room assembly or uncrating for platform beds?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Complimentary standard worldwide shipping covers delivery to your address (doorstep or curbside freight) and does not include inside room carrying, uncrating, or assembly services unless explicitly arranged in writing. Because solid wood platform beds are substantial handcrafted pieces, we recommend having two people available on delivery day or hiring a local white-glove installation service."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is a box spring required for a WRYDECO branch headboard platform bed?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. WRYDECO platform beds feature integrated solid hardwood slat support systems engineered to directly support memory foam, latex, or pocket-coil hybrid mattresses without requiring a separate box spring or foundation."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long does it take for a handcrafted solid wood branch bed to be crafted and delivered?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Estimated processing and crafting takes approximately 15 to 20 business days, followed by an estimated 3 to 5 business days in transit after dispatch, for a total estimated delivery window of 18 to 25 business days. Timelines are estimates rather than guaranteed delivery dates."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I modify my order or cancel if I made a mistake on bed size or wood finish?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. WRYDECO provides a 6-hour Golden Window immediately after ordering during which you can cancel your order for a 100% free refund or change size, finish, and shipping details by contacting support@wrydeco.com. Once the 6-hour window closes, production begins and orders cannot be canceled."
      }
    }
  ]
